  /// CALL_STARTED | GREETING_SENT | INTENT_DETECTED | KNOWLEDGE_SEARCHED | LEAD_QUALIFIED |
  /// TOOL_STARTED | TOOL_COMPLETED | APPOINTMENT_CONFIRMED | CRM_UPDATED | SUMMARY_CREATED |
  /// MEMORY_UPDATED | FSM_TRANSITION | AGENT_RUN_STARTED | AGENT_RUN_COMPLETED |
  /// SUPERVISOR_RETRY | SUPERVISOR_RECOVERED | CALL_COMPLETED
